===== Device Info and Specifics =====

The WNDR3400 utilizes Broadcom architecture brcm47xx. 

Different factory firmware seem to contain different nvram variables that affect board detection code. 
Board detection via Kernel ( arch/mips/bcm47xx/board.c patched in trunk) works (flashed from Netgear firmware WNDR3400-V1.0.0.50_20.0.59-OFW.chk; another earlier version didn't work ).
Board detection in package broadcom-diag isn't implemented yet (2013-02-23). FIXME //This information is quite old. Please verify and update this section, then remove this fixme.//
